  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 25 ÷ 5 - 2 × 30 + 3 = 10.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ÷ and +**\n\nGiven: 25 ÷ 5 - 2 × 30 + 3 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get;\n\n⇒ 25 + 5 - 2 × __**30 ÷ 3**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 25 + 5 - __**2 × 10**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __**25 + 5**__ - 20 = 10\n\n⇒ __30 - 20__ = 10\n\n⇒ **10 = 10**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) × and +\n\nGiven: 25 ÷ 5 - 2 × 30 + 3 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ __**25 ÷ 5**__ - 2 + 30 × 3 = 10\n\n⇒ 5 - 2 + __**30 × 3**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __**5**__ - 2 __**+ 90**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __95 - 2__ = 10\n\n⇒ 93 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷ and -\n\nGiven: 25 ÷ 5 - 2 × 30 + 3 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 25 - __**5 ÷ 2**__ × 30 + 3 = 10\n\n⇒ 25 - __**2.5 × 30**__ + 3 = 10\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 75 __**+ 3**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __28 - 75__ = 10\n\n⇒ -47 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) × and -\n\nGiven: 25 ÷ 5 - 2 × 30 + 3 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ __**25 ÷ 5**__ × 2 - 30 + 3 = 10\n\n⇒ __**5 × 2**__ - 30 + 3 = 10\n\n⇒ __**10**__ - 30 __**+ 3**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __13____ - 30__ = 10\n\n⇒ -17 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
